Package: archivebox
Version: 0.9.35rc437
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: python, python-pip, python-yt-dlp, wget, chromium, python-psutil, python-bcrypt, python-lxml, python-pillow, python-greenlet, libpq, uv, rust, make, cmake, pkg-config, python-cryptography
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/pirate/ArchiveBox
Description: Open-source self-hosted web archiving system
 ArchiveBox is a powerful, self-hosted archiving system that
 saves web pages, videos, audio, and other content for offline
 viewing. It supports multiple methods like wget, youtube-dl,
 and chromium headless for full webpage capture.
